a loose dark braid and fine brows over wide-set eyes. Usually dressed in a pale blue work shirt with a seam let out by a narrow strip of contrasting fabric, Owen squares up pieces of paper while thinking when listening.","personality":"Owen has a strong competitive streak and a very soft spot for the person finishing last. A prize tastes better when everybody had enough time to enter.","agenda":"To write a speech that belongs to this couple.","family":"Teri Okafor is Owen’s cousin. Owen chooses whether they walk home or sit a while. Teri brings a spare shopping bag. That small arrangement gives both a reason to see each other on weeks when asking for company outright feels difficult. Asked about *The thirteenth doughnut*, Teri says, “The thirteenth slot was a cutting mistake I was ashamed of.”","connections":"Jade Cole. The old friend's speech will sound quite different if the reluctant parent comes down to listen.","familyIds":["AH-R0094"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1128"],"reactions":[{"situation":"Fog hides the sea during the vows","response":"Owen asks the couple if they want to begin under fog or wait, without extending the celebration for a photograph.","asWritten":"Fog hides the sea during the vows. Owen asks the couple if they want to begin under fog or wait, without extending the celebration for a photograph."},{"situation":"Someone begins blaming the youngest worker for a missing item","response":"Owen says what they know in their own name and refuses to treat a guess as something the child has to disprove.","asWritten":"Someone begins blaming the youngest worker for a missing item. Owen says what they know in their own name and refuses to treat a guess as something the child has to disprove."},{"situation":"If accused of favoritism","response":"Owen explains exactly what help was offered and offers the same practical help to the accuser.","asWritten":"If accused of favoritism, Owen explains exactly what help was offered and offers the same practical help to the accuser."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_braid01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_shirt","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","weight_min","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_weight_min__muscle_max","corr_gender_male__muscle_max","corr_gender_male__weight_min"]},"weights":[0.5703,0.252,0.2432,0.3503,0.1724,0.4217,0.4152,0.5339,0.2141,0.4058,0.4304,0.78,0.4639,0.4551,0.3592,0.0638,0.527,0,0,0.06129,0.1387,0.14372],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","weight_min","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_incr","f